      "authority": "R1_R2_EXTERNAL",
      "locator": "Cook's membrane, a standard finite-element distortion benchmark (R.D. Cook, 1974). No closed-form solution; the reference is the fine-mesh converged tip displacement at the loaded-edge midpoint Q, PLANE STRESS, E=1, nu=1/3, unit shear resultant: normalized u_Q*E*t/P = 23.91 (literature band 23.90-23.96). The plane-strain counterpart is 21.52 (Sevilla et al. / locking-free FCFV report 21.42 converged); DCR walls are plane stress (membrane section), and 21.42/(1-nu^2) ~= 23.9 confirms the plane-stress mid-edge value.",
